The SDV Trip the Light Fantastic, the Trip for short, was a warship of the Fifth [[Org/The Fifth Prosperous Empire of the Sundom|Sundom]]. Its crew are the people the [[Phenomena/Althane/Cycle|cycle]] reseeds [[Geography/Althane/index|Althane]] with. Pieces of it lie across the world.

One fragment is a hidden, high-technology outpost underground near the corpse of the Beast in [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/index|the Gulch]], monitoring the Beast's vitals as if to make sure it stays dead. There [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]] found a map of the Trip's other pieces and of the Kaathe orbs on Althane: one in Oresk (where [[People/Althane/Halidex Op-B|Hali]] and [[People/Althane/Tennobrin Er-K|Tenno]] were held), one in Illyara, one deep underground in the Leviathan, and one miles and miles up, which they guessed was on [[Geography/Althane/The Thirteenth Realm|the Thirteenth Realm]].
